    "title": "Nanticoke Indian Museum Heritage Day | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nNanticoke Indian Museum Heritage Day\nNanticoke Indian Museum Heritage Day, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m., 26673 John J. Williams Hwy., Millsboro. Celebrates legacy & continued presence of Nanticoke Tribe. Enjoy traditional dancing, drumming, native crafts, storytelling and food. Free admission. For more information contact info@nanticokeindians.org or 302-945-3400.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 05/02/2026 - 11:00am to 3:00pm",
